quick one, firmware cloud team here. we have a lambda that devices call to push their config and i changed it to also store wifi info. tell me what's wrong with it, we ship tomorrow

```python
def update_config(event, ctx):
    cfg = json.loads(event["body"])
    device_id = event["pathParameters"]["device_id"]

    ssid = cfg["network"]["wifi"]["ssid"]
    devices.put_item(Item={
        "device_id": device_id,
        "ssid": ssid,
        "target_temp": cfg.get("target_temp"),
        "schedule": cfg.get("schedule", []),
    })

    if not isinstance(cfg.get("target_temp"), (int, float)) or not (5 <= cfg["target_temp"] <= 35):
